stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: Checkout
  pending --> confirmed: Accept
  pending --> cancelled: Cancel + reason
  confirmed --> preparing: Start preparing
  confirmed --> cancelled: Cancel + reason
  preparing --> ready: Ready for pickup
  preparing --> cancelled: Cancel + reason
  ready --> completed: Mark delivered
  completed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]

  note right of confirmed
    DB value: confirmed
    UI label: Accepted
  end note
  note right of completed
    DB value: completed
    UI label: Delivered
  end note
